OL,3,GNEWSASix taken to hospital after crash
OL,4,Ain Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a crash in Aberdeen.
OL,9,FThe collision - involving three
OL,10,Fvehicles - happened on the city's
OL,11,FSpringhill Road at about 17:05 on
OL,12,FWednesday.
OL,14,FEmergency services closed the road for
OL,15,Finvestigation, but it has since
OL,16,Freopened.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland said inquiries to
OL,19,Festablish the full circumstances of the
OL,20,Fcrash were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
